    "credentialsHelpUrl": "https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/2026-10/queries/products",
    "instructions": "Use your own installed Shopify app Admin access token. SHOPIFY_STORE is only the myshopify.com store label. Grant read_products for reads and write_products for approved title updates. Responses may contain GraphQL errors/userErrors even with HTTP200; inspect these before treating a change as successful. For managed GraphQL import, retrieve a version2026-10 schema from your own authenticated Admin GraphQL endpoint using standard __schema introspection as described in the official About GraphQL reference, or use Shopify GraphiQL explorer. This package does not bundle a vendor schema."
  },
